{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"1f013f6426b27f8cb555c22229b6c039f0c3bf25e128f377b49ae37cdbaeeacb","digest":{"component_or_area":"Jira reconcile bridge outbound comment sync","key_entities":["comment_ids","RECONCILER_MARKER","_normalize_comment_body","outbound_comments.py","adapters/jira/comment_limits.py","_TRUNCATION_SUFFIX","REB-1861","REB-1580","REB-1829","run 32403944666","aa7b-5e47-6d3d-4615","bd80-0603-7d44-4d9f","712020:6471376f-4e5e-4ed2-8c05-330827bc387e","GET /rest/api/3/issue/{key}/comment"],"problem_keywords":["duplicate comments","jira reconciliation","bot-authored echoes","deduplication","comment cleanup"],"propositions":["The reconcile-bridge outbound comment sync had an inert PRIMARY id-dedup (comment_ids empty), causing it to re-post the same bot-authored comments on every hourly pass, accumulating 30,847 duplicates across 30 Jira issues and pinning REB-1861 at the 5000-comment hard cap","Phase 1 cleanup deleted 29,931 duplicate bot-authored comments across 27 of 30 affected issues by keeping the oldest copy of each distinct normalized body (detected via pre-strip RECONCILER_MARKER, deduplicated via _normalize_comment_body, verified post-deletion that each distinct body retained exactly one instance)","Phase 2 (836 truncation-suffix comments on REB-1567/REB-1931/REB-2605) was deliberately left unexecuted as a separate operator decision; these lack the marker because outbound truncation at 32767 chars cut off the trailing marker paragraph","Pre-deletion backup (150MB, 27 issues) with completeness gate (fetched==total) was written and verified before any DELETE, and post-deletion re-fetch independently confirmed zero missing distinct bodies and unchanged non-candidate counts","Every DELETE honored Retry-After on 429 with 713+ throttles absorbed; 0 failed deletions across 29,931 calls; append-only deletion log (29,931 lines) permits resumability","Reconcile-bridge workflow remains PAUSED (disabled_manually) throughout and was NOT re-enabled; a separate defect (marker loss on truncation) is filed separately"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787712790422528001,"uuid":"6ee43fd6-238e-42fa-8ad1-242489f903c1"}